{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"88cb5d63c0b1edbb046337a00041f3596c43d6f086dfb61bc28367d7ad759ca0","ja":"幸せな婚約","zh":"幸福的订婚","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d7cbd2e4345e387047770417d2b1ef44542bbc21084b76bf935719613ea823c2","ja":"美也！　大事な用って……もしかしてその日に、\n婚約の顔合わせが……なーんて、あははは……。","zh":"美也！所谓的重要事情……难道是那天要去\n相亲订婚……开玩笑啦，啊哈哈哈……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"192227a3d642d9d98e907fca67d1ee21dc8ac5415dbf8632c92bb87e27d81ac0","ja":"おや～？　よくご存知ですね～。\n実はそうなんですよ～。","zh":"哎呀～？您很清楚嘛～。\n其实就是这样哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"429d8eaab5b8e55110f13be0149357a08682a7db5876f02cf942d523ba43f6cb","ja":"なんと……！\nおめでとうございます……？","zh":"竟然……！\n恭喜您……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"35b8435f873bb82c197fd52fd305ba80d3a5552e44879fa2379ba09f03116f9c","ja":"す……すごいすごーい！\n婚約おめでとう～～～！！","zh":"好……好厉害好厉害——！\n恭喜订婚～～～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9d6d2e32c33fdbbc85ad1958933ea3f67fef3d320f5b6ccc255f35a92d230280","ja":"はい、とってもおめでたいです～。\nおふたりも祝福していたと、お伝えしておきますね～。","zh":"是的，真的很值得庆祝呢～。\n我会转告大家，两位也送上了祝福哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4d03ee57fa6d973ac44fd854d22f9eebda74e0c28089ea43e7f64da2cf89695a","ja":"……？　あの、\n宮尾さんが婚約するのではないのでしょうか？","zh":"……？那个，\n不是宫尾小姐要订婚吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dc77311f0fbdcb3bf293c85fc6f30730598dd5bee597f0d4c2e4f851387a3b38","ja":"違いますよ～。婚約するのは……\n将棋仲間のおじいさんの、お孫さんです～。","zh":"不是啦～。要订婚的是……\n棋友老爷爷的孙子啦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"265738d73b967d8f1700e31ea900ba7d578cb29416b190763640cead9c730b03","ja":"……えええっ！？","zh":"……诶诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9913e754aa985c4f4fae459f29a1acc46cf6c4aac59b226d032ab015219f699b","ja":"なるほど、すっかり誤解していました。\n……早とちりだぞ。","zh":"原来如此，完全是我误会了。\n……你想得太武断了啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"da5a0dcefba99e5c1062a75edc99b173ba7a6ad2c149ca999124e2075f87d189","ja":"そうだよね……あ、でも、それじゃあ美也は、\n日曜日に何の用事があるの？","zh":"也是呢……啊，不过，那美也\n星期天有什么事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"31d16717ef2b49695cd9cfd30959c5d0e45e3ee2c3f00d4b341c225db6b8aea5","ja":"それはですね～、おじいさんが顔合わせに行けるように\n将棋大会の係を、私が代わりに引き受けたんです～。","zh":"那是因为～，为了让爷爷能去参加见面会，\n我就代替他接下了象棋大赛的工作～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2d9f5566d43c282902fa2317c7feff63eba466d0e0a62be8fa76a06af04d2a5f","ja":"とても大事な日なので、私も何か力になれればと～。","zh":"因为是非常重要的日子，所以我想着自己要是也能帮上什么忙就好了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1a346c63aea5910aa54674f2f7197fc11defe95714637bc14691c460bce6928e","ja":"さすが宮尾さん。\nとても優しい気づかいですね。","zh":"真不愧是宫尾。\n真是非常体贴呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"252f8d27973b2e0fce14290c1f61441c1cf2ed165b2a4b242e07ec3e9100292b","ja":"それならおじいさんも、\n安心して顔合わせに行けるね！","zh":"这样的话，爷爷也能\n放心地去见面了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1259.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"be1a5d20ce6b26186a884e6ea8b9ed7e3c361fc3a884547ca28eb7e41258c791","ja":"ふふふ～。お祝いする人もされる人も……\nみんなが幸せになれるといいですな～♪","zh":"呵呵呵～。无论是送上祝福的人，还是接受祝福的人……\n要是大家都能收获幸福就好了呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
